WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.179 --> 00:00:15.040
was furious.

2
00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.640
"The Bull Demon King tricked me!"

3
00:00:19.081 --> 00:00:21.842
The monkey rushed back to the cave and smashed the door.

4
00:00:25.262 --> 00:00:27.223
The Bull Demon King ran outside.

5
00:00:27.243 --> 00:00:29.544
"You villain!"

6
00:00:29.904 --> 00:00:30.504
he shouted.

7
00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.022
"You destroyed my door!"

8
00:00:33.042 --> 00:00:35.924
"Give me that fan right now!"

9
00:00:36.165 --> 00:00:36.985
yelled Wukong.

10
00:00:37.005 --> 00:00:39.908
"Or I'll destroy the rest of your mountain!"

11
00:00:39.928 --> 00:00:43.391
"Never!" said the demon.

12
00:00:45.073 --> 00:00:46.834
Wukong charged toward the demon.

13
00:00:49.837 --> 00:00:52.319
The demon turned into a crane and flew away.

14
00:00:52.339 --> 00:00:57.004
"He's not the only one who can turn into other animals," thought the monkey.

15
00:00:59.196 --> 00:01:02.399
Wukong turned into a phoenix and shot after the crane.

16
00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:07.763
With his claws out, he swooped down at the crane.

17
00:01:08.644 --> 00:01:11.166
The crane dipped lower and Wukong missed.

18
00:01:12.287 --> 00:01:14.970
When Wukong looked back, the crane was gone.

19
00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:16.851
"Where did he go?"

20
00:01:17.151 --> 00:01:17.932
thought Wukong.

21
00:01:18.633 --> 00:01:21.655
He looked down and saw an antelope grazing in a field.

22
00:01:21.675 --> 00:01:22.956
"That's him!"

23
00:01:25.138 --> 00:01:26.900
landed and turned into a tiger.

24
00:01:27.884 --> 00:01:29.745
He crept through the tall grass.

25
00:01:31.507 --> 00:01:33.728
When he got close to the antelope, he leaped.

26
00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:40.292
Light flashed, and the antelope turned into a huge white bull.

27
00:01:41.874 --> 00:01:45.056
The bull flew up into the sky, and Wukong followed.

28
00:01:46.417 --> 00:01:49.178
He had almost caught up to the bull, when he heard a shout.

29
00:01:50.379 --> 00:01:51.260
back, Wukong!"

30
00:01:52.721 --> 00:01:54.162
It was a soldier from Heaven.

31
00:01:55.183 --> 00:01:57.124
"The Jade Emperor sent us to help you."

32
00:01:58.292 --> 00:02:00.053
More soldiers rushed toward the bull.

33
00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:04.656
With a snort, the bull spun around and flew the other way.

34
00:02:05.416 --> 00:02:08.718
But other soldiers appeared and blocked the bull's path.

35
00:02:09.819 --> 00:02:12.600
Wukong watched as soldiers surrounded the bull.

36
00:02:13.661 --> 00:02:17.883
They moved in closer, their swords and spears all pointed at the bull.

37
00:02:20.565 --> 00:02:23.526
Bull Demon King returned to his demon form.

38
00:02:23.546 --> 00:02:27.572
"Please, don't hurt me!"

39
00:02:27.672 --> 00:02:30.134
The Iron Immortal was rushing toward the soldiers.

40
00:02:31.175 --> 00:02:32.015
harm my husband!"

41
00:02:32.335 --> 00:02:32.856
she cried.

42
00:02:32.876 --> 00:02:35.097
"He didn't mean to be evil!"

43
00:02:36.338 --> 00:02:37.979
One soldier lowered his sword.

44
00:02:37.999 --> 00:02:41.182
"We won't harm you if you're truly sorry for being evil.

45
00:02:41.842 --> 00:02:44.984
But right now you're stopping the Tang Monk from continuing his journey.

46
00:02:45.985 --> 00:02:47.586
Sun Wukong needs your fan."

47
00:02:48.647 --> 00:02:51.108
The Iron Immortal handed the fan to the soldier.

48
00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:53.930
the fan," she said.

49
00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.808
"We are truly sorry.

50
00:02:56.868 --> 00:02:59.369
My husband and I will be good Buddhists from now on.

51
00:03:00.049 --> 00:03:01.869
Just please, don't hurt us."

52
00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:04.870
The soldier looked at the Bull Demon King.

53
00:03:05.891 --> 00:03:06.811
The demon nodded.

54
00:03:06.831 --> 00:03:08.111
"We promise."

55
00:03:10.112 --> 00:03:11.432
well," said the soldier.

56
00:03:11.452 --> 00:03:14.113
"You two may return to your cave.

57
00:03:15.193 --> 00:03:17.134
But you must stay out of trouble from now on."

58
00:03:18.214 --> 00:03:20.235
The demon and his wife bowed and left.

59
00:03:22.455 --> 00:03:24.736
The soldier handed the fan to Wukong.

60
00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:29.521
"It's good that you'll be the one to put out the Mountain of Flames, Wukong."

61
00:03:30.521 --> 00:03:32.082
Wukong was confused.

62
00:03:32.102 --> 00:03:36.723
"Why?" "You're the one who caused the fire," said the soldier.

63
00:03:41.164 --> 00:03:43.405
was when Laozi tried to burn you up in his pot.

64
00:03:44.165 --> 00:03:47.466
You leaped out of the pot, disturbing the fire in his workroom.

65
00:03:48.546 --> 00:03:51.967
A burning ember fell to Earth that day and started the fire on the mountain."

66
00:03:53.868 --> 00:03:54.708
looked at the fan.

67
00:03:55.556 --> 00:03:57.477
"I'll be happy to put out the fire."

68
00:03:59.838 --> 00:04:01.339
Wukong returned to the village.

69
00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:06.002
The Tang Monk and his companions were at the old man's house again.

70
00:04:06.942 --> 00:04:10.064
Once again they thanked the man and followed the road up the hill.

71
00:04:11.465 --> 00:04:14.046
At the top they looked at the Mountain of Flames.

72
00:04:15.327 --> 00:04:17.268
Wukong lifted the fan and waved it.

73
00:04:20.729 --> 00:04:22.590
Instantly the fire went out.

74
00:04:23.791 --> 00:04:28.695
The air cooled down, and Wukong saw the valley start to turn green.

75
00:04:30.076 --> 00:04:34.260
Leaves grew on trees, and small flowers popped up here and there.

76
00:04:35.701 --> 00:04:39.665
Birds sang in the branches as other animals ran through the grass.

77
00:04:41.146 --> 00:04:44.789
smiled. He had done evil things a long time ago.

78
00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:47.252
Now he was fixing them.
